  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.<br><br>We have all heard of the big family reunion where people get to see relatives they may not have been able to for some time. As well, we have seen the movies where a large group of people gather, and adventures ensue. Many of us would love to organize some sort of large gathering such as this; however, it can be difficult considering that the number of people joining one's vacation can quickly go up. Finding a place for all these people can be tricky, but your search is over as the Looking Glass Cottage and Carriage House is the perfect place for you and your large party!<br><br>The First Floor<br><br>As you walk to your new home, the first thing you'll find is the lovely outdoor area that features not only a cozy sitting area, but even a pool and hot tub! Inside, you'll find the first floor which features the features several of the home's main rooms. For instance, you'll find the first guest bedroom complete with a king bed as well as a walk-in shower. You'll also find a second guest bedroom that comes complete with a comfortable and cozy king bed. You'll also find two bunk rooms, one of which comes with its own bathroom. You'll also find the living room, which thank to the large windows has a sunny and welcoming look to it. Enjoy access to a private balcony that comes complete with a sitting area to enjoy your meal as you gaze out at a setting sun. The kitchen also appears here and features white cabinets, a gas burning stove, and a breakfast bar. You and your guests can eat together in the dining area that comes complete with a large table with large, sunny windows for the group to feast together. <br><br>The Second and Third Floors<br><br>Exploring further you will find the second floor which sports a king bed, as well as a lovely sitting area at the top of the stairs. Further, you'll find another bathroom upon this level, making it like one large room, perfect for the couple or introvert looking to join the fun. Climbing higher, you'll find the third floor which offers the third guest room featuring two double beds, making this perfect for any lone individuals joining your adventure. <br><br>The Carriage House<br><br>Of course, in addition to the main house, you also will be able to enjoy the benefits of the carriage house. This small home sits just above the garage and features a lovely living area complete with sleeper sofa. The kitchen is quite beautiful with cherry red wooden cabinets and glittering granite counter tops. You'll even find a large dining area complete with a wooden table. To top it all off, you'll find both a queen bed as well as bunk beds, allowing you to bring even more guests along on your adventure and exploring. <br><br>Garage parking for two vehicles.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
